{"id": "29fc5e12-fbfd-4417-812a-4bf9ee9ef26b", "slug": "aurelis-intelligence-beyond-boundaries", "title": "Aurelis - Intelligence Beyond Boundaries", "description": "Aurelis Intelligence Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Aurelis - Intelligence Beyond Boundaries\"\ndescription: \"Aurelis Intelligence Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#D4AF37\"\n  secondary: \"#080808\"\n  accent: \"#D4AF37\"\n  background: \"#D4AF37\"\n  surface: \"#EAE2D3\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Cinzel\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aurelis - Intelligence Beyond Boundaries\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 153; favorites: 8; remixes: 1.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nAurelis Intelligence Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAurelis Solutions Research Industries Company Insights Private Access Scroll to discover + Aurelis AI INTELLIGENCE BEYOND BOUNDARIES We build sovereign AI systems that reason, adapt, and elevate what's possible. Explore…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: INTELLIGENCE BEYOND BOUNDARIES; Enterprise AI; Research Labs; Sovereign Infrastructure; Built for Visionaries.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #D4AF37, secondary #080808, accent #D4AF37, background #D4AF37, surface #EAE2D3, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Cinzel for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased text-gray-200 bg-[#050505]\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aurelis - Intelligence Beyond Boundaries</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r134/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@200;300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #080808;\n            color: #d1c8b8;\n            /* Hide scrollbar but allow scrolling if absolutely necessary on tiny devices, though layout is designed to fit */\n            -ms-overflow-style: none;\n            scrollbar-width: none;\n        }\n        body::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            display: none;\n        }\n        .font-serif { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; }\n\n        /* Premium Gradient Border Utilities */\n        .border-gradient-mask {\n            position: relative;\n            background: linear-gradient(#080808, #080808) padding-box,\n                        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4), rgba(255,255,255,0.05)) border-box;\n            border: 1px solid transparent;\n        }\n        .border-gradient-mask-subtle {\n            position: relative;\n            background: linear-gradient(#080808, #080808) padding-box,\n                        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) border-box;\n            border: 1px solid transparent;\n        }\n\n        /* Tech Crosshairs */\n        .crosshair::before, .crosshair::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n        }\n        .crosshair::before { width: 10px; height: 1px; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); }\n        .crosshair::after { width: 1px; height: 10px; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); }\n\n        /* Sparkline animation */\n        @keyframes spark {\n            0% { stroke-dashoffset: 100; }\n            100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }\n        }\n        .spark-path {\n            stroke-dasharray: 100;\n            animation: spark 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"h-[100dvh] w-full overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative selection:bg-[#D4AF37] selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-90\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Technical Background Grid Lines (CSS) -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center opacity-30\">\n        <!-- Center glowing orb backing -->\n        <div class=\"absolute w-[40vw] h-[40vw] rounded-full bg-[#D4AF37] blur-[120px] opacity-10 mix-blend-screen mix-blend-color-dodge\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute w-[60vw] h-[60vw] rounded-full bg-[#1a1712] blur-[80px] opacity-40\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Large Circle -->\n        <div class=\"absolute w-[45vw] h-[45vw] rounded-full border border-white/5 gs-spin-slow\"></div>\n        <!-- Vertical/Horizontal Axis -->\n        <div class=\"absolute w-full h-[1px] bg-white/5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute h-full w-[1px] bg-white/5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Target boxes -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[20%] left-[30%] w-16 h-16 border border-white/10 opacity-50\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border-t border-l border-white/40\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[25%] right-[32%] w-24 h-24 border border-white/5 opacity-50\">\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border-b border-r border-white/40\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- UI Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full w-full\">\n\n        <!-- Top Navigation -->\n        <header class=\"gs-reveal flex justify-between items-center px-6 lg:px-12 py-6 shrink-0\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sun-2-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-[#D4AF37]\"></iconify-icon>\n                <div class=\"font-light text-base tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-white\">Aurelis</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-12 absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase\">Research</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase\">Industries</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase\">Company</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase\">Insights</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-3 text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors uppercase\">\n                    Private Access\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-white/50\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <button class=\"w-8 h-4 flex flex-col justify-between items-end group\">\n                    <span class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-white group-hover:w-3/4 transition-all duration-300\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"w-3/4 h-[1px] bg-white group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Area -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 flex relative w-full overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <!-- Left Edge Indicator -->\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:flex w-12 flex-col items-center justify-between pb-24 pt-12 border-r border-white/5 shrink-0 gs-reveal\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full border border-white/20\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#D4AF37]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full border border-white/20\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#D4AF37] opacity-50\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[0-[10px]] text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500 uppercase -rotate-90 whitespace-nowrap origin-center translate-y-12\">Scroll to discover</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-gray-500 mt-24\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Hero Left Content -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center px-8 lg:px-16 z-10 max-w-2xl gs-stagger\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-[#D4AF37] mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"font-light\">+</span> Aurelis AI\n                </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[5rem] leading-[0.9] tracking-tighter text-[#EAE2D3] mb-8 w-[120%]\">\n                    INTELLIGENCE<br>\n                    BEYOND<br>\n                    BOUNDARIES\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-gray-400 font-light max-w-sm mb-12 leading-relaxed\">\n                    We build sovereign AI systems<br>\n                    that reason, adapt, and <em class=\"font-serif italic text-gray-300\">elevate</em><br>\n                    what's possible.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8\">\n                    <!-- Gradient Border Button -->\n                    <div class=\"border-gradient-mask inline-flex group cursor-pointer\">\n                        <div class=\"px-8 py-4 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-white hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors\">\n                            Explore Solutions\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lg opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors group\">\n                        Watch Manifesto\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-white/50 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Tech Details (Bottom left of center visual) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 left-[35%] text-[10px] tracking-widest text-gray-500 uppercase leading-relaxed gs-reveal hidden xl:block\">\n                Model A7<br>\n                Nexus Architecture<br>\n                Ver. 3.2.1\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Data Panel -->\n            <div class=\"w-full lg:w-[28%] flex flex-col justify-center items-end px-8 lg:pr-16 z-10 absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 lg:relative lg:top-0 lg:translate-y-0 gs-reveal pointer-events-none lg:pointer-events-auto opacity-10 lg:opacity-100 mix-blend-screen lg:mix-blend-normal\">\n\n                <!-- Glassy Tech Card -->\n                <div class=\"border-gradient-mask-subtle w-full max-w-[280px] rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-md bg-[#0a0a0a]/60 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <!-- Corner marks -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 w-1 h-1 border-t border-l border-white/30\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-1 h-1 border-t border-r border-white/30\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 w-1 h-1 border-b border-l border-white/30\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-1 h-1 border-b border-r border-white/30\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 crosshair w-4 h-4 opacity-50\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col gap-8\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[10px] tracking-widest text-gray-500 uppercase mb-4\">System Status</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs tracking-wider text-gray-300 uppercase border-b border-white/10 pb-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                                Nexus Core Online\n                                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-900 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Sparkline -->\n                            <div class=\"h-8 w-full mt-4 flex items-center\">\n                                <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                                    <path d=\"M0,10 L10,12 L20,8 L30,15 L40,5 L50,12 L60,8 L70,18 L80,10 L90,14 L100,6\"\n                                          fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1\"\n                                          class=\"spark-path\"/>\n                                    <!-- Dots -->\n                                    <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#D4AF37\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n                                    <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"18\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#D4AF37\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n                                    <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#D4AF37\"/>\n                                </svg>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[10px] tracking-widest text-gray-500 uppercase mb-2\">Learning Velocity</div>\n                            <div class=\"font-serif text-4xl tracking-tight text-[#EAE2D3] mb-1\">2.4x</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[9px] tracking-widest text-gray-600 uppercase\">Vs. Baseline</div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[10px] tracking-widest text-gray-500 uppercase mb-2\">Alignment</div>\n                            <div class=\"font-serif text-4xl tracking-tight text-[#EAE2D3] mb-1\">99.7%</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[9px] tracking-widest text-gray-600 uppercase flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                Stable\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Edge Indicator -->\n            <div class=\"hidden lg:flex w-16 flex-col items-center pt-24 border-l border-white/5 shrink-0 relative gs-reveal\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-12 crosshair w-6 h-6 border border-white/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-[#D4AF37] rounded-full\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] text-gray-400 uppercase rotate-90 whitespace-nowrap origin-center mt-32\">Ethical By Design</span>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Cards Section -->\n        <footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row w-full shrink-0 bg-[#080808]/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-20 gs-reveal\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1 -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-white/5 p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors relative\">\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 mb-6 font-serif italic\">01</div>\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-300 mb-3\">Enterprise AI</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-[200px]\">\n                        Custom AI systems designed for complex, high-stakes environments.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 w-8 h-8 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-500 group-hover:text-[#D4AF37] group-hover:border-[#D4AF37]/50 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2 -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-white/5 p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors relative\">\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 mb-6 font-serif italic\">02</div>\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-300 mb-3\">Research Labs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-[200px]\">\n                        Pioneering the next frontier in reasoning, memory, and autonomous learning.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 w-8 h-8 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-500 group-hover:text-[#D4AF37] group-hover:border-[#D4AF37]/50 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3 -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-white/5 p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors relative\">\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 mb-6 font-serif italic\">03</div>\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-300 mb-3\">Sovereign Infrastructure</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-[200px]\">\n                        Secure, compliant, and fully sovereign deployment for modern enterprises.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 w-8 h-8 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-500 group-hover:text-[#D4AF37] group-hover:border-[#D4AF37]/50 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:add-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 4 (CTA) -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 p-6 lg:p-8 flex items-center gap-6 group cursor-pointer bg-gradient-to-br from-transparent to-white/[0.01] hover:to-white/[0.03] transition-colors\">\n                <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:border-[#D4AF37] transition-colors\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-[#D4AF37] transition-colors\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-300 mb-2\">Built for Visionaries</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-gray-500 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                        Partner with Aurelis to shape the future—responsibly.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Background & Center Object (Three.js) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            // Center camera to match layout focal point\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n            camera.position.z = 10;\n            camera.position.x = window.innerWidth > 1024 ? 1 : 0; // Shift right on desktop to align with empty space\n\n            // 1. Ambient Particles\n            const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 1000;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 20;\n            }\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n            const particlesMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.02,\n                color: 0x888888,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.3,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, particlesMaterial);\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            // 2. Central Complex Geometry (Mimicking the reference rock)\n            // Using a TorusKnot to get a complex, twisted, self-shadowing organic shape\n            const geo = new THREE.TorusKnotGeometry(2.5, 0.8, 256, 64, 2, 3);\n\n            // Premium Dark Bronze/Gold Material\n            const mat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({\n                color: 0x2a2118, // Very dark brown base\n                metalness: 0.9,\n                roughness: 0.4,\n                wireframe: false,\n            });\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geo, mat);\n            // Position adjustment to center visually between text and cards\n            mesh.position.y = 0.5;\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            // 3. Lighting (Crucial for the premium dark look)\n            const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.5);\n            scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n            const dirLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xd4af37, 2); // Gold tint light\n            dirLight.position.set(-5, 5, 5);\n            scene.add(dirLight);\n\n            const pointLight = new THREE.PointLight(0xffffff, 1); // Edge rim light\n            pointLight.position.set(5, -5, -5);\n            scene.add(pointLight);\n\n            // Resize Handler\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.position.x = window.innerWidth > 1024 ? 1 : 0;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Slow rotation for ambient feel (no rapid spinning/floating)\n                mesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n                mesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n\n                // Subtle particle movement\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.01;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n            animate();\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        const initAnimations = () => {\n            gsap.set(\".gs-reveal\", { opacity: 0, y: 20 });\n            gsap.set(\".gs-stagger > *\", { opacity: 0, y: 30 });\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n\n            // Ensure fonts/WebGL are somewhat ready before flashing UI\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                // Header & Edges\n                tl.to(\"header.gs-reveal\", { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1 })\n                  .to(\".gs-reveal.w-12, .gs-reveal.w-16\", { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1 }, \"-=0.8\")\n\n                // Hero Content Stagger\n                  .to(\".gs-stagger > *\", { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.15 }, \"-=0.5\")\n\n                // Right Panel & Bottom Cards\n                  .to(\".gs-reveal.absolute.right-0, .gs-reveal.absolute.bottom-24\", { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1 }, \"-=0.6\")\n                  .to(\"footer.gs-reveal\", { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1 }, \"-=0.8\");\n\n                // Continuous subtle CSS rotation for background elements\n                gsap.to(\".gs-spin-slow\", {\n                    rotation: 360,\n                    duration: 100,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    ease: \"none\"\n                });\n            }, 100);\n        };\n\n        // Initialize on load\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initAnimations();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aurelis-intelligence-beyond-boundaries.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aurelis-intelligence-beyond-boundaries.jpg", "source_name": "aurelis-intelligence-beyond-boundaries-DESIGN.md", "views": 270, "forks": 8, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T13:18:21.525987+00:00"}